<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - June 3.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - June 3.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JORNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- The governor of Cabinda, Jose Tati, said in an interview that the military situation in the enclave was still unstable.</p>
<p>- Miguel Nzau Puna, the vice minister of territorial administration, said the process of extension of state administration into UNITA areas should continue to ensure peace in Angola.</p>
<p>--Luanda newsroom +2442 360-849</p>
